# Shared configuration for every app in the monorepo.
#
# This file declares variable NAMES, TYPES and SENSITIVITY only — never values.
# Values come from 1Password locally and from ECS task definitions when deployed.
# Per-app schemas live in apps/<app>/.env.schema and import this one.
#
# Sensitivity is fail-closed: varlock treats every item as sensitive unless it
# is explicitly marked public. When adding a variable, mark it public only if
# you are certain the value is safe to print.
#
# NOTE: decorator names must never appear with a leading at-sign in prose here.
# Varlock parses every at-token in a comment block as a decorator, so a sentence
# mentioning one is read as a redeclaration with the sentence as its value.
#
# This file uses env-spec — see https://varlock.dev/env-spec
#
# This file deliberately does not set currentEnv. It is only ever imported, and
# an imported directory that sets it forces every importer to include the flag
# in its pick list ("API_ENV is not included in the import list") while varlock
# simultaneously requires the flag to be declared in the importing file itself.
# Each app therefore declares API_ENV and sets currentEnv locally.
#
# @defaultRequired=infer
# ---

# Deployment environment. Set by ECS when deployed, dev locally. Each app
# redeclares this; it is kept here so the root schema is loadable on its own.
# @public @type=enum(dev, prod)
API_ENV=dev

